---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE_EMAIL, SITE_GITHUB, SITE_INSTAGRAM, SITE_LINKEDIN, SITE_SUBSTACK } from '../consts';
---

<Page title="About · Declan Curran" description="A bit about Declan Curran.">
	<header class="page-head">
		<span class="kicker">about</span>
		<h1>Hi, I'm Declan.</h1>
		<p class="question">Weishenme? (Why?)</p>
	</header>

	<figure class="portrait">
		<img src="/media/portrait.jpg" alt="Declan in a beanie and puffer jacket, looking up into the trees" />
	</figure>

	<p>
		I'm finishing a research Master's in Computer Science focused on <a href="/work/">climate downscaling</a>:
		using machine learning to take coarse global climate model output and turn it into fine-grained, locally
		useful predictions you can plan around.
	</p>
	<p>
		Outside the research I love helping businesses solve problems with data, and the messier and more
		cross-disciplinary the problem, the better. I'm drawn to healthtech, climate, economics, and anything at
		the boundary of AI, science and human behaviour.
	</p>
	<p>
		I learn languages for the same reason I ask too many questions. On a study tour in Liaoning, a guide
		nicknamed me <em>Weishenme</em>, Mandarin for "Why?". I write <a href="/blog/">short stories, poems and
		travel essays</a>, shoot <a href="/photos/">night skies</a>, and travel as much as work allows.
	</p>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section-head">
			<span class="num">→</span>
			<h2>Elsewhere</h2>
		</div>
		<ul class="hello mono">
			<li><span>email</span><a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`}>{SITE_EMAIL}</a></li>
			<li><span>linkedin</span><a href={SITE_LINKEDIN}>in/declan-curran</a></li>
			<li><span>substack</span><a href={SITE_SUBSTACK}>@jacquessauvage</a></li>
			<li><span>github</span><a href={SITE_GITHUB}>Declan-Curran1</a></li>
			<li><span>instagram</span><a href={SITE_INSTAGRAM}>@declan_curran</a></li>
		</ul>
	</section>
</Page>

<style>
	.page-head {
		padding-top: 3.2rem;
	}
	.portrait {
		max-width: 320px;
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
	}
	.portrait img {
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: 50% 25%;
	}
	.hello {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
	}
	.hello li {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 6.5rem 1fr;
		padding: 0.25rem 0;
	}
	.hello span {
		color: var(--muted);
	}
</style>
